      },
      "text": "Dance is organized movement of the human body, usually in time with music, for aesthetic purposes. It is the oldest of the performing arts (predating writing by tens of thousands of years), the most universal (every human culture has it), and the most ephemeral (until notation and recording systems were developed, it existed only in performance and in the bodies of trained dancers)."
    },
    {
