      "text": "```\nROMANTIC BALLET (1830-1870)\n----------------------------\nA revolution in content, style, and technology:"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-DANCE.md#012",
      "path": [
        "08-DANCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
