        "title": "Dance",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONTENT SHIFT:\n  From court allegory and mythology to supernatural\n  tales of sylphs, wilis, and spirits.\n  The ballerina became the focus (not the male dancer)."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-DANCE.md#013",
      "path": [
        "08-DANCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:theater-performance:08-dance, git-history:theater-performance:08-dance]",
        "canonical_path": "theater-performance/08-DANCE.md",
