        "current_path": "theater-performance/08-DANCE.md",
        "id": "maxim:theater-performance:dance",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "theater-performance",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[dance]",
        "section": "theater-performance",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Dance",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. Corps de ballet patterns\n   Large groups of women dancing in geometric formations:\n   lines, circles, chevrons, waves.\n   Swan Lake's corps of 16-24 swans is the archetype.\n   The corps as visual texture and structural rhythm."
    },
