      "text": "KEY WORKS (with Tchaikovsky):\n  Swan Lake (1877 original; Petipa/Ivanov revival 1895)\n  The Sleeping Beauty (1890)\n  The Nutcracker (1892)\n  These three are the core classical ballet repertoire.\n  Tchaikovsky's scores remain the gold standard of ballet music.\n```"
