      "text": "```\nBALLETS RUSSES (Sergei Diaghilev, 1909-1929)\n---------------------------------------------\nThe most important company in 20th-c ballet.\nDiaghilev (impresario) assembled the best choreographers,\ncomposers, and designers of the era:\n  Choreographers: Fokine, Nijinsky, Massine, Nijinska,\n    Balanchine\n  Composers: Stravinsky (Firebird 1910, Petrushka 1911,\n    Rite of Spring 1913), Prokofiev, Debussy, Ravel\n  Designers: Picasso, Matisse, Cocteau"
    },
